    {
        "text": "The whistle pierces through the thick fog, the incantation spreading in ripples."
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing needs to be spoken, nothing needs to be written..."
    },
    {
        "text": "The concealed dead have nowhere to hide. the Sudaram's piercing shriek forms into a longsword that shuttles through the fog."
    },
    {
        "text": "The words from the whistle quiver, and the Banshee's song resounds\u2013\u2013"
    },
    {
        "text": "Within the ancient bloodlines of the Sarkaz, in a valley choked with Originium, amidst the lamentations of countless people who fell in battle..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Flaming shells and witchcraft-imbued rounds intertwine in the skies above the battlefield."
    },
    {
        "text": "A high-speed battleship crashes into a witchcraft bastion."
    },
    {
        "text": "A small number of Victorian soldiers charge head-first into an entire squad of Nachzehrers."
    },
    {
        "text": "The song grows louder and clearer."
    },
    {
        "text": "When that song reaches its climax, the Nachzehrer soldiers fall into silence and stop attacking one after another, like motionless flags."
    },
    {
        "text": "They no longer hunt."
    },
    {
        "text": "At last, death has returned to the land."
    },
