    {
        "text": "War has come to answer your song.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "The withered branches retreat in unison. They coil, then lie down, returning once more to their long-deceased forms."
    },
    {
        "text": "The most hideous and ancient among them still seem to be struggling unwillingly, finally twisting into a scepter."
    },
    {
        "text": "The tip of the scepter strikes the ground, and a figure emerges from the depths of the dense fog."
    },
