    },
    {
        "text": "Aefanyl... The master of the Elegiac Court.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nezzsalem"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1339_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You chose to stay behind and face me alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nezzsalem"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The corners of his clothes flutter, as the fog disperses."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sudaram's white robes are scattered across the dense white hills of withered branches. Longswords lie fallen and shattered, like grass in a forest."
    },
    {
        "text": "The young Banshee sits sideways atop the hill, his bloodstained fingers plucking at the bone whistle in front of his lips..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Gentle. Melodious."
    },
